SUMMARY:WRC — Let's Run — Palisadoes Strip
LOCATION:Palisadoes Strip\, Kingston\, Jamaica
DESCRIPTION:Wadada Run Club — Let's Run!\nBeginners welcome.\n\nBeginner friendly — all paces welcome.\nMeeting point: Palisadoes Strip\, 6:15 PM.\nParking: First lay-by on the right at the start of the paved sidewalk.\nPlan:\n1. Warm-up dynamic drills — 10 minutes.\n2. Run block — 45–60 minutes.\n3. Cool-down stretches — 10 minutes.\n4. Group photo and taillights.\nArrive on time\, bring a friend or two\, and bring drinking water.
